      <p style="text-indent: 1em" rend="first-line-indent(1)" source="#source-669-3251"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-672-696"><rb>此度</rb><rt>このたび</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-696-699">　</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-699-768"><rb>英照皇太后陛下</rb><rt>えいせうくわうたいごうへいか</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-768-771">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-771-801"><rb>御大喪</rb><rt>ごたいさう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-801-804">に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-804-816"><rb>就</rb><rt>つ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-816-834">きましては、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-834-873"><rb>日本国中</rb><rt>にほんこくぢう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-873-876">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-876-900"><rb>人民</rb><rt>じんみん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-900-903">は</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-903-927"><rb>何社</rb><rt>なにしや</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-927-936">でも、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-936-960"><rb>総代</rb><rt>そうだい</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-960-972">として一</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-972-990"><rb>名</rb><rt>めい</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-990-996">づゝ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-996-1026"><rb>御拝観</rb><rt>ごはいかん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1026-1029">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1029-1041"><rb>為</rb><rt>た</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1041-1047">めに</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1047-1071"><rb>京都</rb><rt>きやうと</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1071-1086">へ出す事に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1086-1107"><rb>相成</rb><rt>あひな</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1107-1122">りました。</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1122-1140"><rb>処</rb><rt>ところ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1140-1143">で</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1143-1158"><rb>数</rb